BHSPitMonkey/ha-mxz-coordinator
-------------------------------

Source: https://github.com/BHSPitMonkey/ha-mxz-coordinator
Used: commit 4ebc59d, by Stephen Eisenhauer: the accept-changes-at-the-head option.
Its adoption path and tests are adapted in
custom_components/mxz_coordinator/coordinator.py and
tests/test_accept_head_changes.py, with this project's write memory in place of the
comparison with the room's target, and on by default. License: MIT, as this project's.

ha-climate-zone-sequencer
-------------------------

Source: https://github.com/csingley/ha-climate-zone-sequencer
Used: commit f911e4a, models.py: Zone.observe, Zone.lost, Zone.status, and
Zone.vote (a zone's vote is live, stale, expired, or unknown). Adapted as
HeadSight in custom_components/mxz_coordinator/logic.py, which MXZ uses for a
head it has lost sight of.
Idea only, no code copied: commit f911e4a, sensor.py: a zone's optional
comfort_priority entity, read as a number, that orders zones within their
urgency tier. MXZ's Comfort priority (custom_components/mxz_coordinator/logic.py,
comfort_priority and arbitrate) takes the idea and maps the entity differently.
